{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Noce7Xlp6t1795709556.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>聯交所對清盤中的中國恒大、恒大物業及七名董事，採取紀律行動。</p><p></p><p>聯交所向中國恒大及恒大物業作出譴責，並對中國恒大主席許家印、前執行董事兼行政總裁夏海鈞等七人，作出損害投資者權益聲明及譴責。</p><p></p><p>個案關於在恒大物業向中國恒大提供134億元人民幣財務資助一事中，兩間公司嚴重違反《上市規則》，及相關董事嚴重違反《上市規則》下的職責。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T17:04:24.325734+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:13.377340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:57:39.127742+00:00","content_hash":"0222cf603bf74f40c4c2b87527f29ceb48a4642136ba616687c2c1f89bc8fb3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T17:04:24.325734+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}